## 3. Problem Statement & Purpose

> What problem does your application solve? Who is it for? Why is it useful?

[Managing a library manually can be time-consuming and make it difficult to track books, borrowing records, and overdue books.

SmartLib provides a simple web-based system to manage books and borrowing records. Students can search, borrow, and return books, while administrators and librarians can manage the library efficiently.

The system is designed for schools, colleges, and small libraries ]

