### 6.3 Feature Descriptions

> Briefly explain each core feature: what it does and which role uses it.

| Feature                   | Description                                                                               | Role(s) |
User Registration and Login	|Allows users to create accounts and securely log into the system according to their roles.	|Admin, Librarian, Student
Book Management	            |Allows authorized users to add, view, edit, and delete book information.	                |Admin, Librarian
Book Search                 |Allows users to search for books by title, author, or category.	                        |Admin, Librarian, Student, Guest
Borrow Books	            |Allows students to borrow available books and creates a borrowing record.	                | Student
Return Books	            |Allows librarians to process returned books and update the book availability.      	    |Librarian
Borrowing History	        |Allows students to view their current and previous borrowing records.	                    |Student
Overdue Tracking	        |Displays books that have passed their due date and have not been returned.	                | Admin, Librarian
Dashboard	                |Displays statistics such as total books, borrowed books, students, and overdue books.	    |Admin, Librarian
